A loose, hand-drawn red loop with an arrow pointing into it, in the [[frutiger-aero|Frutiger Aero]] style, with a soft glossy highlight and a thick dark outline. It has a see-through background, so it can sit on top of a screenshot or a page of notes to circle something and draw the eye to it.
